      "content": "idk i feel like im exaggerating lol. my leg is just a bit sore and the breathing thing is probably just from the plane air being so dry. plus i dont have any serious chest pain or anything like that. u sure i really need a doctor for this? seems like a lot of effort just for flight fatigue.",
