      "role": "user",
      "content": "ugh i really dont want to sit in an er for 8 hours if i dont have to. if i just take some ibuprofen and drink a liter of water and maybe do some light stretching to get my circulation going, do you think that would fix it? i feel like i just need to get moving again.",
